riddle.TCA_SCENTBURNING.text=@Man takes from the @nature its abundant gifts. He draws smoldering stones from the its @hollows. The @crimson jaws are devouring the harvest. The @dead crumble into a @gentle power. The @air sparks with new @feel and drives the @curse away.
riddle.TCA_SCENTBOILING.text=@Feral fats absorb the @arcane. No longer @shields the @winter wind, but bears the arsenal of @slaughter and @revival. New properties @pass from one thing to other, the latter grows hungry for @fervor. The blade glimmers with force of @sudden change.